@ Look up an element based on it's symbol.  Returns the index into the
table of elements or zero if no such symbol.

@<Functions...@>=
      function element_lookup(symbol)
      integer element_lookup    // Function
      character*(*) symbol      // Input
      el_common                 // Common
      st_common
      
      element_lookup=string_lookup(symbol,element_sy,el_num)

      return
      end

